<title>DENMARK: SOCCER-DANISH SUPER LEAGUE RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DANISH SUPER LEAGUE RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of soccer match in</p>
<p>the Danish super league over the weekend.</p>
<p>Aalborg	  2   FC Copenhagen 0</p>
<p>Aarhus	   6   Silkeborg     1</p>
<p>Brondby	  1   Vejle	   2 </p>
<p>Herfoelge	2   AB		1  </p>
<p>Lyngby	   0  Viborg	   3  </p>
<p>Odense	   2  Hvidovre	 1  </p>
<p>Standings (tabulated under played, won, drawn, lost, goals  for,</p>
<p>against, points):</p>
<p>Brondby	  10  8  1  1 20-8  25</p>
<p>Aalborg	   9  7  0  2 21-11 21</p>
<p>Aarhus	   10  5  1  4 27-16 16</p>
<p>Vejle	    10  3  4  3 15-11 13</p>
<p>Lyngby	   10  4  1  5 15-19 13</p>
<p>Odense	   10  4  1  5 14-18 13</p>
<p>Herfoelge	10  4  1  5  7-12 13</p>
